{"speciesId":594,"names":{"fr":"Mamanbo","es":"Alomomola","en":"Alomomola","ja":"ママンボウ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La membrane spéciale qui entoure son corps a la capacité de guérir les blessures."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The special membrane enveloping Alomomola has the ability to heal wounds."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il vit en dérivant dans les grands océans. Quand il trouve des Pokémon blessés, il les ramène jusqu’à la côte."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Floating in the open sea is how they live. When they find a wounded Pokémon, they embrace it and bring it to shore."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It gently holds injured and weak Pokémon in its fins. Its special membrane heals their wounds."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It gently holds injured and weak Pokémon in its fins. Its special membrane heals their wounds."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vit en dérivant dans les grands océans. Quand il trouve des Pokémon blessés, il les ramène jusqu’à la côte."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive flotando a la deriva en mar abierto. Siempre que encuentra un Pokémon herido, lo abraza y lo lleva a la costa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Floating in the open sea is how they live. When they find a wounded Pokémon, they embrace it and bring it to shore."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大海原を 漂って 暮らす。 傷ついた ポケモンを 見つけると 抱きかかえて 岸まで 運ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il berce les Pokémon blessés dans ses nageoires et les guérit grâce à la membrane dont il est recouvert."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Abraza gentilmente con sus aletas a Pokémon que están lastimados y cura sus heridas con su membrana especial."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It gently holds injured and weak Pokémon in its fins. Its special membrane heals their wounds."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"傷ついたり 弱った ポケモンを ヒレで 優しく 抱えながら 特殊な 粘膜で 治すのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il vit en dérivant dans les grands océans. Quand il trouve des Pokémon blessés, il les ramène jusqu’à la côte."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vive flotando a la deriva en mar abierto. Siempre que encuentra un Pokémon herido, lo abraza y lo lleva a la costa."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Floating in the open sea is how they live. When they find a wounded Pokémon, they embrace it and bring it to shore."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大海原を 漂って 暮らす。 傷ついた ポケモンを 見つけると 抱きかかえて 岸まで 運ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il berce les Pokémon blessés dans ses nageoires et les guérit grâce à la membrane dont il est recouvert."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Abraza gentilmente con sus aletas a Pokémon que están lastimados y cura sus heridas con su membrana especial."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It gently holds injured and weak Pokémon in its fins. Its special membrane heals their wounds."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"傷ついたり 弱った ポケモンを ヒレで 優しく 抱えながら 特殊な 粘膜で 治すのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il recueille les Pokémon blessés et referme leurs plaies grâce à son mucus spécial. Par pur altruisme ? Nul ne le sait."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se acerca a los Pokémon heridos y cura sus heridas con la mucosidad especial que segrega. Se desconoce el motivo de este comportamiento."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It uses its special mucus to close the wounds of injured Pokémon. The reason for this behavior remains unknown."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"傷ついた ポケモンを 抱きしめ 特殊な 粘液で 傷を ふさぐ。 その理由は 不明。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il se laisse dériver au gré des courants océaniques profonds. De nombreux Pokémon Eau se rassemblent toujours autour de lui."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Vive flotando a la deriva en mar abierto. Muchos Pokémon de tipo Agua se arremolinan a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They float upon the open sea. Many water Pokémon gather in the area around Alomomola."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"大海原を 漂って 暮らす。 ママンボウの 周りには 多くの みずポケモンが 集まってくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ses talents de guérisseur sont tels que les marins l’emportent quand ils embarquent pour une longue traversée."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Los pescadores siempre lo llevan consigo en las travesías largas, porque al tener un Alomomola no les hacen falta ni medicinas ni médicos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Fishermen take them along on long voyages, because if you have an Alomomola with you, there’ll be no need for a doctor or medicine."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"漁師は 長い 航海の とき 連れていく。 ママンボウが いれば 医者も 薬も いらないからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"On pense qu’il protège les Pokémon affaiblis parce qu’il partage avec eux les mêmes prédateurs."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se cree que ayuda a los Pokémon heridos y debilitados de forma que los depredadores naturales de estos no le ataquen a él también."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The reason it helps Pokémon in a weakened condition is that any Pokémon coming after them may also attack Alomomola."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"弱った ポケモンを 助けるのは それを 狙う ポケモンに 自分も 襲われるから らしい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":594,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[11,"level-up",13],[14,"level-up",13],[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[1